## Fleet repairs and services

The repairs a fleet actually books, in the volumes a fleet books them:

- Brake system repairs
- Suspension system repairs
- Tire repairs and replacements
- Transmission diagnostics and repairs
- Wheel alignment services

## Preventative maintenance for fleets

Scheduled work is what keeps a yard predictable. Our PM service covers tire
inspections and rotations, brake inspections, fluid checks and replacements, and
battery testing, on an interval set against the way your units are actually run
rather than a number off a chart.

{% callout tone="note" title="This page is the work; the program is next door" %}
